{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"canasta-card-game UI copy.limits","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"canasta-card-game.copy.limits","keys":["canasta-card-game.copy.limits"],"locale":"ha","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Wannan wani nau'i ne na 'yan wasa biyu da suke wasa da wani mai adawa na kwamfutar gida mai sauki, ba 'yan wasa da yawa a kan intanet ba ko kuma wasa da kudi. Yana amfani da manufar ZXQPH0000QXZ-point, ZXQPH0001QXZ-card deal, biyu-card draw da matsaloli na buɗewa da suka dogara da sakamako. Ka'idojin tebur na bambanta: wannan sigar ba ta aiwatar da izinin hadin gwiwa na fita ba, kyautai na musamman na hannun da aka ɓoye, zaɓuɓɓukan maye gurbin ruwan hoda- uku, ko kuma ƙa'idojin gida na ɗabi'a. Idan ba za'a iya samar da katunan biyu ba, to za'a yi wasa da shi.","record_id":"a85052eaadf896f33f702813c1e8c6904d6049af66f19cadcc5b6dc4ca064b46","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":3.6026287648750213,"source":"This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"18eb51470cf7c3e8d0a4161c143b09519122c00980735a56ead28bf88b2dbd54","status":"needs-review","translation":"Wannan wani nau'i ne na 'yan wasa biyu da suke wasa da wani mai adawa na kwamfutar gida mai sauki, ba 'yan wasa da yawa a kan intanet ba ko kuma wasa da kudi. Yana amfani da manufar 5,